The retention of the runs of the object in the store, the `keep` of the
store section when not set. A list of rules, a run kept by any of them
being kept:

`<n>`
  The `<n>` latest runs.

`<n>h`, `<n>d`, `<n>w`, `<n>m`, `<n>y`
  The latest run of each of the `<n>` latest hours, days, weeks (Monday to
  Sunday), months or years holding a run.

The periods are in UTC, of the time a run started. The runs are deleted
whole, every member of a run together, after each run written whole.
Without `keep`, no run is ever deleted.
